An [[Enchanted Brambles]] resembles a six-legged bush of twigs that has a tail. They can be quite dangerous as their area damage skills cause [[condition]]s. Having several of them trigger different skills will stack on quite a number of conditions on a bunched up party. [[Health regeneration]] or condition removal skills can help reduce their effectiveness.

